@@ -9262,3 +9262,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE E (CAPSTONE .401, UNGATED) -- the verifier scorecard + the DiffusionGemma GATE DECISION (replicate-or-retire), using the ROBUST aggregate-available-report-gaps helper (NO hard-block-all-False). Headline questions: (1) did the in-generation oracle-distinct moat REPLICATE with the LEAK-ROBUST scorer on the 2nd corpus (exp4337 scorer_leak_audit_passed -> exp4338 in_generation_moat_replicates, CI95-excl-0)? -> does the DiffusionGemma gate (diffusiongemma-energy-guided-diffusion-spec.md THE GATE: oracle-distinct learned-verifier win + matched control + CI95-excl-0, LEAK-ROBUST, replicated) now flip MET -- or is the in-generation moat RETIRED as corpus-specific (retire_if_same_verdict fired)? (2) did Phase B/C land the FIRST E3 ARC solve (exp4339 ar25 / exp4340 ka59 / exp4341 sc25 offline_reproduced) -> reproducible_total_levels? (3) did the action-role cross-game encoder transfer (exp4342) or log a 3rd null? Aggregate (skipping flagged, reporting missing as per-axis gaps; HONORING verifier_is_oracle -- the E3 solves are execution-grounded verifier_is_oracle=true ARC progress NOT a moat; the in-generation/self-learning results are oracle-distinct verifier_is_oracle=false). Cite each upstream sha256. Emit in_generation_moat_replicates_headline + diffusiongemma_gate_status + arc_reproducible_total_levels + verifier_thesis_state (one honest string). Compute the G1-G4 publication gate via publication_gate.py. NO gated_on. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: v401_in_generation_replicated_leak_robust_gate_MET_oracle_distinct_leak_robust_replicated_arc_levels_17_e3_reproduced_2_self_learning_open_hygiene_passed; results/experiment_4346_capstone_v401.json
 - 2026-06-17: [conductor] Operational retrospective for milestone 2026.06.401 (results/operational_retro_2026_06_401.json, schema carnot.operational_retro.v64). The authoritative milestone-scoped timing detector again false-zeroed (0 experiment commits since activation), so the locked timing fields are 0/empty (0 experiments, 0 compute-bound, 0 wall-time min) and gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null (both RTX 3090s correctly idle at the 19:35Z snapshot -- 0 compute-bound tasks, so idle is correct behaviour, not a bug). Per the ops/changelog.md window read this turn, .401 DID run (exp4336-exp4346 incl. capstone results/experiment_4346_capstone_v401.json), confirming the recurring .363-.400 false-zero now extends to .401. Operational bottleneck = OBSERVABILITY (timing-detector gap + missing per-experiment wall-time telemetry), NOT execution; top action = repair the milestone-scoped timing detector (mtime scan + changelog-window fallback) + write-time duration_s/compute_bound stamping, and emit detector_gap_suspected when artifacts exist on disk but the detector reports 0. No GPU/DualGPURunner change warranted (no compute-bound or parallel multi-model task in the retro's authoritative data; DualGPURunner applies only to 2+ parallel models). estimated_time_savings_pct=5.
 - 2026-06-17: Archive .401 -> activate .402; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the TRUE .401 close-state truthfully (per exp4346 capstone, corrected for the post-capstone outer-loop tn36 solves): the IN-GENERATION ORACLE-DISTINCT MOAT REPLICATED LEAK-ROBUST -> DiffusionGemma gate MET (exp4338 in_generation_moat_replicates=true, carnot_minus_best_control_delta +0.358, carnot_minus_self_reward_smc_delta +0.321, replication_ci95 [0.283,0.4375] excl 0, n=240, scorer_leak_recheck_passed=true, verifier_is_oracle=false; scorer exp4337 leak-audit passed: masked-answer AUROC 0.56 ~ chance, process-ranking 0.70); FIRST E3 ARC SOLVES (ar25 L1 exp4339, sc25 L1 exp4341); ARC now 21 reproducible levels / 13 games (registry 2026-06-17, authoritative -- the exp4346 capstone's 17 was pre-tn36-L4/L5/L6 outer-loop solves); ka59/tr87/ft09 still partial (E3 0.56/partial); CROSS-GAME VALUE TRANSFER NULLED a 3rd time (exp4342, reduction CI95 [1.0,1.017]) and RETIRED on the exclusion manifest; CROSS-DOMAIN SELECTION stays RETIRED (exp4314); paper_ready=True (FoVer 0.9131, G1-G4 pass). NOTE the exp4346 capstone carried a CIRCULAR_MOAT_OVERCLAIM flag because it omitted verifier_is_oracle (a STAMPING bug -- the underlying exp4338 is correctly verifier_is_oracle=false; the moat is genuinely oracle-distinct). Frame .402 as CONVERT-the-proven-moat-to-a-generation-gain (S3) + E3-ARC-DEEPER + learned-action-cost-self-learning. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v401_v402_active_moat_replicated_leak_robust_gate_MET_arc21_e3_ar25_sc25_cross_game_transfer_retired_pretest_green; results/experiment_4347_archive_v401_activate_v402.json
+- 2026-06-17: PHASE A1 (HEADLINE; convert the PROVEN moat into a generation GAIN) -- S3 STRATIFIED VERIFIER-GUIDED DENOISING SEARCH (arXiv:2604.06260 VERIFIED) using the .401 LEAK-ROBUST scorer. .401 PROVED the in-generation oracle-distinct moat exists (exp4338, leak-robust, replicated, CI95-excl-0) -- but a proven moat is a MEASUREMENT; the north-star §5 win condition is UTILITY: the verifier earns its place when it makes generation MORE ACCURATE AT EQUAL COMPUTE (Pareto-improve the base generator). S3 (Stratified Scaling Search, 2604.06260) is the instrument: at each DiffusionGemma denoising step, expand K candidate partial states, score them with the leak-robust exp4337 scorer (the in-loop verifier), resample the promising ones while preserving frontier diversity -> a reward-tilted sampling distribution anchored to the model prior. The DECISIVE test is at a FIXED NFE (denoising compute) budget: does S3-Carnot beat (a) best-of-K@matched-NFE (the same compute spent on K independent samples + final selection -- the must-beat compute-matched baseline), (b) unguided single-pass, and (c) self-reward SMC (2602.01849, the model's INTRINSIC confidence -- the sharpest oracle-distinct test)? Reuse the .401 skeptic-proof harness: the no-op DEGENERATE_CONTROLS guard (controls_differentiated) + an INDEPENDENT leak re-check on the scorer. Emit s3_guided_beats_control BARE bool := (S3-Carnot - best-of-K@NFE > 0 AND its CI95 excludes 0 AND controls_differentiated AND S3-Carnot - self-reward-SMC > 0) at FIXED NFE, n>=80, >=3 seeds. verifier_is_oracle=false. A win = the moat graduates 'exists'->'useful' (Pareto-improves generation). An honest null (the proven scorer does NOT convert to a fixed-NFE generation gain) is decision-grade. NO TRAINING (test-time search only); NO TRM training; DiffusionGemma via the llama.cpp PR binary. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=controls_not_differentiable; results/experiment_4348_s3_stratified_verifier_guided_search.json
